Robot model assets
------------------

Robot model assets (URDF / MJCF / USD meshes) are NOT distributed with this
repository. They are fetched from each vendor's upstream repository by
assets/fetch.py and remain under their respective upstream licenses. The pinned
upstream source for each robot is recorded in assets/registry.py.
